{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"sinew_bundle","model_identifier":"sinew_bundle","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## sinew_bundle\n\nCarried load, animal goods.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.9..1.9, y -11.5..1.5, z -1.4..1.4 (size 3.8 x 13.0 x 2.8 u = 11 x 37 x 8 cm).\nSinew bundle: a hank of pale dried sinew cords (~32 cm) looped over the fist and tied below it, hanging down. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 11.5.\n"},"description":"## sinew_bundle\n\nCarried load, animal goods.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.9..1.9, y -11.5..1.5, z -1.4..1.4 (size 3.8 x 13.0 x 2.8 u = 11 x 37 x 8 cm).\nSinew bundle: a hank of pale dried sinew cords (~32 cm) looped over the fist and tied below it, hanging down. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 11.5.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"hank_a","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,-10.0,-1.25],"to":[-0.25,0.0,1.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16,0,17.25,10.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[10,0,12.5,10.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[18,0,19.25,10.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[13,0,15.5,10.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[28,0,29.25,2.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[30,0,31.25,2.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"07d9d32a-e781-5826-bb43-f6e3a056e775"},{"name":"hank_b","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[0.25,-10.5,-1.25],"to":[1.5,0.0,